   "priceMinor": 61400,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "This variant of the Rocket was created as a special edition for British Watchmakers Day 2026, held at Lindley Hall in London. Further Concept Editions will be created alongside future models, as a way of exploring alternative colours, materials and designs in limited numbers. The Concept Edition colourway features a vertical gradient dial, shifting from a light purple/pink colour to light blue, with the colour also running across the rehaut. In addition there is white printing on the dial in a design unique to this variant, and a matching white seconds hand. Supplied on a stainless steel bracelet, as well as a white FKM rubber strap and a light blue FKM strap, all with quick-release spring bars for easy, tool-free strap changes. This watch is a limited edition with only 45 pieces available. It will not be repeated.",
